Very mild spoiler.  I don't know any good ones :)

One way I can think of escaping from wands of sleep is getting sleep
resistance as early as possible.  As it happens, I have never been zapped
by one.  Plenty of others, though.

When you have sleep resistance and step in a gas trap, you get a message
like: "You feel mildly lethargic" or some such, and nothing much happens. 
I expect it would work the same with with wands of sleep. 

One sure fire way of getting sleep resistance is eating elves. Or playing
as one, since thay start with this strinsic.  Apart from telepathy,
it is one of the easier to get, I normally get eat after eating just three
or four elves.

Of course, if all the above is wrong and you loose your favourite
character, well, I'm sorry.  But I don't think so.

Good luck!
